    "description": "Round 3 review point 5 (openspec change round3-review-points). A pipelinq notification such as 'Client changed: X' arrived without a link, so it led nowhere. The canonical x-openregister-notifications dialect (ADR-031) has an `actions[]` list; a target of kind `object-detail` is resolved by OpenRegister's AnnotationNotificationDispatcher to the deep link pipelinq registers for the schema (DeepLinkRegistrationEvent), so the button opens the record's own pipelinq page. This fragment gives every pipelinq rule one primary 'Open' action. It only adds `actions` to rules that other fragments declare; tests/Unit/Settings/ReviewRound3RegisterTest.php fails when a rule has no Open action, or when this fragment names a rule nobody declares."
  },
